{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/gsap/from_fromto_immediaterender/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h2 id=\"immediaterender\" style=\"position:relative;\">immediateRender<a href=\"#immediaterender\" aria-label=\"immediaterender permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>즉시렌더, <code class=\"language-text\">from()</code> 및 <code class=\"language-text\">fromTo()</code> 트윈의 <code class=\"language-text\">immediateRender</code> 속성은 예상치 못한 결과가 나올 때만 알게 되는 것 중 하나입니다. 이 예상치 못한 결과는 동일한 엘리먼트에 동일한 <code class=\"language-text\">from()</code> 또는 <code class=\"language-text\">fromTo()</code> 트윈이 여러 개 설정되어 있을 때 나타납니다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"gsap-작동-방식-필수-개념-요소\" style=\"position:relative;\">GSAP 작동 방식 필수 개념 요소<a href=\"#gsap-%EC%9E%91%EB%8F%99-%EB%B0%A9%EC%8B%9D-%ED%95%84%EC%88%98-%EA%B0%9C%EB%85%90-%EC%9A%94%EC%86%8C\" aria-label=\"gsap 작동 방식 필수 개념 요소 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">from()</code>과 <code class=\"language-text\">fromTo()</code> 트윈의 경우 GSAP는 <code class=\"language-text\">immediateRender</code>를 <code class=\"language-text\">true</code>로 기본값을 가집니다.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">to()</code> ~부터: 현재 원래 위치에서 보내고 싶은 이동 까지 –> 0 부터 1 까지</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">from()</code> ~까지: 시작 위치부터 원래 값 까지 –> 1 부터 0까지</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>immediateRender: 즉시 렌더</strong><br>\n<code class=\"language-text\">from()</code> tween은 즉시 CSS 속성을 주고 시작하기 때문에 즉시렌더이다.<br>\n이 설정이 중첩으로 사용되었을 때 글리치 에러가 발생한다.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"prompt-tip\">\n<p>글리치: 주로 정전기처럼 아주 짧은 순간 팍 하고 일어나는 오류를 일컫는다.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"글리치가-발생하는-경우\" style=\"position:relative;\">글리치가 발생하는 경우<a href=\"#%EA%B8%80%EB%A6%AC%EC%B9%98%EA%B0%80-%EB%B0%9C%EC%83%9D%ED%95%98%EB%8A%94-%EA%B2%BD%EC%9A%B0\" aria-label=\"글리치가 발생하는 경우 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>아래 코드를 실행하면 <code class=\"language-text\">imediateRender: true</code>로 인해 글리치가 발생한다.<br>\n<code class=\"language-text\">.from(\".orange\", { opacity: 0 })</code> 의 상태를 기억해 <code class=\"language-text\">opacity: 0</code> 으로 멈춘다.<br>\n<code class=\"language-text\">immediateRender</code> 는 기본속성이 <code class=\"language-text\">true</code> 로 설정되어 있기 때문이다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> tl <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> gsap<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">timeline</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">defaults</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">duration</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\ntl<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">from</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\".orange\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">opacity</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">y</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">50</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// opacity 0 -> 1</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">from</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\".pink\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">opacity</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">y</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">50</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">from</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\".blue\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">opacity</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">scale</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">1.2</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">immediateRender: false</code> 로 설정하면, <code class=\"language-text\">opacity 0</code>을 기억하는게 아니래 본래 <code class=\"language-text\">.orange</code>의 <code class=\"language-text\">1</code>을 기억하게 되어 제대로 동작한다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token comment\">// ...</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">from</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\".orange\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">opacity</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">immediateRender</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">false</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"스크롤-시-배경색이-바뀌는-navigation-구현\" style=\"position:relative;\">스크롤 시 배경색이 바뀌는 navigation 구현<a href=\"#%EC%8A%A4%ED%81%AC%EB%A1%A4-%EC%8B%9C-%EB%B0%B0%EA%B2%BD%EC%83%89%EC%9D%B4-%EB%B0%94%EB%80%8C%EB%8A%94-navigation-%EA%B5%AC%ED%98%84\" aria-label=\"스크롤 시 배경색이 바뀌는 navigation 구현 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>스크롤 값에 따라 상단에 고정되어 있는 네비게이션의 배경 색상이 변경되는 애니메이션을 구현해야 할 때,<br>\n루프 안에 ScrollTrigger를 생성하고, 그 안에 navigation에 대한 색상 변경 애니메이션을 적용하는 방식으로 구현할 것이빈다. 이 때 기본적으로 <code class=\"language-text\">immediateRender: true</code>로 설정되기 때문에 각 <strong class=\"fc-primary\">트윈이 시작 값을 즉시 기록</strong>하므로 약간의 Glitch(글리치)가 발생합니다.</p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">immediateRender: false</code> 로 설정하여, <code class=\"language-text\">from()</code> 의 위치를 제어할 수 있다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> navColor <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'#ebdec1'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'#e9aab1'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'#92e0d3'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'#52becb'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'#f17683'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> section <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> gsap<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>utils<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">toArray</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'.section'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">map</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">o</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> o<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getBoundingClientRect</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>top<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> nav <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> document<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">querySelector</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'.nav'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> navH <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> nav<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>clientHeight<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\ngsap<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>utils<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">toArray</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'.section'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">forEach</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">o<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> i</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// loop 안에 ScrollTrigger 생성</span>\r\n  ScrollTrigger<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">create</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">trigger</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> o<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token function-variable function\">start</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token template-string\"><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span><span class=\"token string\">top </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">${</span>nav<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>offsetHeight<span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">px</span><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token function-variable function\">end</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token template-string\"><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span><span class=\"token string\">bottom </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">${</span>nav<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>offsetHeight<span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">px</span><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">animation</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> gsap<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">to</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>nav<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">backgroundColor</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> navColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>i<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">immediateRender</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">false</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\t<span class=\"token comment\">// immediateRender: false 꺼야함</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">toggleActions</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'restart none none reverse'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// enter, leave, enterback, leaveback</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">markers</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">true</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<br>\n<h5>참고</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://aluvy.github.io/gsap/demo/scrolltrigger-NavigationLoop/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Navigation Loop | github | aluvy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://gsap.com/resources/immediaterender/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">immediateRender | GSAP | Docs &#x26; Learning</a></li>\n</ul>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#immediaterender\">immediateRender</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#gsap-%EC%9E%91%EB%8F%99-%EB%B0%A9%EC%8B%9D-%ED%95%84%EC%88%98-%EA%B0%9C%EB%85%90-%EC%9A%94%EC%86%8C\">GSAP 작동 방식 필수 개념 요소</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#%EA%B8%80%EB%A6%AC%EC%B9%98%EA%B0%80-%EB%B0%9C%EC%83%9D%ED%95%98%EB%8A%94-%EA%B2%BD%EC%9A%B0\">글리치가 발생하는 경우</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%EC%8A%A4%ED%81%AC%EB%A1%A4-%EC%8B%9C-%EB%B0%B0%EA%B2%BD%EC%83%89%EC%9D%B4-%EB%B0%94%EB%80%8C%EB%8A%94-navigation-%EA%B5%AC%ED%98%84\">스크롤 시 배경색이 바뀌는 navigation 구현</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Oct 6, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"from(), fromTo(): immediateRender","summary":"immediateRender 즉시렌더, from() 및 fromTo() 트윈의 immediateRender 속성은 예상치 못한 결과가 나올 때만 알게 되는 것 중 하나입니다. 이 예상치 못한 결과는 동일한 엘리먼트에 동일한 from() 또는 fromTo() 트윈이 여러 개 설정되어 있을 때 나타납니다.","date":"May 29, 2024","categories":["GSAP"],"tags":[""],"author":["aluvy"],"thumbnail":null}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/gsap/from_fromto_immediaterender/","prev":{"slug":"/posts/gsap/scrolltrigger_toggleclass/","title":"ScrollTrigger: ToggleClass"},"next":{"slug":"/posts/gsap/scrolltrigger_scroll_based-progress/","title":"ScrollTrigger: Scroll based Progress"}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1397594759","2043619371"],"slicesMap":{}}